@startuml
title Диаграмма развёртывания Kittygram Plus
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Пользователь\n(браузер / Postman)" as Client

cloud "GitHub Actions" as CI {
  component "CI: tests, build,\npublish, deploy" as Pipeline
}
cloud "Docker Hub" as Hub

node "VPS 89.125.39.139\nDocker Compose" as VPS {
  node "gateway\nNginx :80\nпубличный :8080" as Gateway
  node "backend\nDjango REST + Gunicorn :8000" as Backend
  database "db\nPostgreSQL 16" as DB
  node "frontend\nReact build copier" as Frontend

  folder "static_value" as Static
  folder "media_value" as Media
  folder "pg_data" as PgData
}

Client --> Gateway : HTTPS/HTTP\n/api/, /auth/, /api/docs/
Gateway --> Backend : reverse proxy
Gateway --> Static : React + Django static
Gateway --> Media : /media/
Backend --> DB : PostgreSQL :5432
Backend --> Static : collectstatic
Backend --> Media : uploads
Frontend --> Static : build files
DB --> PgData : persistent data

Pipeline --> Hub : push images\nbackend, frontend, gateway
Pipeline --> VPS : SSH deploy\npull + compose up
Hub --> VPS : pull latest images

note right of Gateway
  Swagger UI: /api/docs/
  OpenAPI: /api/schema/
end note

note bottom of Backend
  Entry point запускает migrate
  и collectstatic последовательно.
end note
@enduml
